# Explicit submission path budget (8 MiB maximum):
# dist/ <= 2 MiB; public/ <= 2 MiB; src/, scripts/, docs/, config and lockfile <= 1 MiB.
# Target total <= 5 MiB, leaving 3 MiB headroom. dist/ is deliberately included.
**/node_modules/
**/.npm/
**/.cache/
**/.vite/
**/.vite-temp/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/.playwright-mcp/
test/scratch/
*.tsbuildinfo
